\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces BudgetedLNS preserves a repaired placement and applies a trial-level migration guard to pressure-localized local search. The previous repaired placement and current persistent-hotspot state define node pressure. The solver retains at most $3B$ risk-ranked tasks, rejects repaired local trials above $B$, and compares admissible candidates lexicographically. Its final repair records any solver-output override and the excess above $B$; the evaluation runner applies the same feasibility repair to all compared methods.}}{7}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
