\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Paired effect sizes from the frozen formal experiment. (a) Satisfaction gain over each comparator. (b) Migration-count reduction. (c) Migration-volume-proxy reduction. Each scenario has 30 paired 200-slot runs at $N=180$; markers identify the implemented comparator and whiskers show the stored paired interval where available. Runtime is retained only as provenance because experiment shards executed concurrently.}}{16}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\@writefile{toc}{\contentsline {subsection}{\numberline {6.4}Component ablation}{16}{subsection.6.4}\protected@file@percent }
