\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces The migration guard exhibits a budget--feasibility trade-off. (a) Run-level satisfaction, (b) total migrations, and (c) recorded repair overrides by guard fraction. Lines and markers are means across 30 runs per scenario; overrides are retained as observed solver-output events and are not relabeled as budget-excess events.}}{19}{figure.7}\protected@file@percent }
